WEBVTT

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:06.340
Let's see.

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:08.010
This nappa cabbage is cheap.

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:11.010
Welsh onions, Shungiku greens...

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:13.520
Some mushrooms would be good, too.

00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:16.850
Some fish... And that should do it.

00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:26.950
Our household sure is growing.

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:33.540
HANDMADE UDON

00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:31.960
It's starting to snow, huh?

00:01:52.990 --> 00:01:55.330
<i>This message is from the student council.</i>

00:01:56.000 --> 00:02:00.340
<i>Due to the forecasted snow, please conclude
your club activates early today,</i>

00:02:00.340 --> 00:02:02.910
<i>and try to get home early.</i>

00:02:02.910 --> 00:02:06.420
It's pretty unusual for us
to have a lot of snow in Fuyuki.

00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:09.840
I heard that we might have
considerable snowfall.

00:02:12.890 --> 00:02:16.180
Then, I guess we should get
all of our grocery shopping done.

00:02:16.550 --> 00:02:20.270
I'm going to stock up on groceries
for tomorrow, okay?

00:02:21.650 --> 00:02:22.940
Thanks, that would be great.

00:02:22.940 --> 00:02:23.820
Sure!

00:02:24.860 --> 00:02:28.360
I have to run an errand,
so I'll see you later.

00:02:30.530 --> 00:02:35.370
With the snow and this cold weather,
I guess for dinner...

00:02:36.830 --> 00:02:38.370
Right!

00:02:43.090 --> 00:02:44.170
Is that Emiya?

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:47.500
- Hello!
- Hello!

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:48.590
Good work!

00:02:48.990 --> 00:02:51.300
Be safe going home in the snow!

00:02:52.550 --> 00:02:55.270
Be safe!

00:02:57.980 --> 00:03:03.940
Ms. Fujimura,
where did you get that kotatsu?

00:03:03.940 --> 00:03:05.770
I brought it from home!

00:03:07.770 --> 00:03:09.370
Mandarin oranges!

00:03:09.370 --> 00:03:12.710
We had a lot at home, so I brought them.

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:15.270
Please have some if you like.

00:03:15.270 --> 00:03:16.280
Thanks!

00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:17.250
And...

00:03:17.950 --> 00:03:19.370
Please get rid of the kotatsu.

00:03:19.370 --> 00:03:22.830
Because it's not sending a good message
to our club members!

00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:25.420
So cold!

00:03:58.330 --> 00:04:00.870
Welcome home, Shirou.

00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:02.890
I'm back, Saber.

00:04:02.890 --> 00:04:04.750
The snow's really starting to come down.

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:06.210
Hurry inside.

00:04:06.540 --> 00:04:08.550
It's nice and warm.

00:04:14.220 --> 00:04:17.180
Shirou, what's for dinner tonight?

00:04:17.970 --> 00:04:20.810
I thought we should have something
that'll warm us up tonight.

00:04:20.810 --> 00:04:23.140
So we're having mixed hot pot!

00:04:23.140 --> 00:04:24.150
Hot pot!

00:04:25.560 --> 00:04:27.690
Start with your konbu broth.

00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:36.160
Let's get started!

00:04:42.410 --> 00:04:46.750
Salt your fish and let it stand for 10 to 15 minutes.

00:04:48.130 --> 00:04:49.250
Slice your Welsh onions diagonally.

00:04:51.090 --> 00:04:53.670
Remove the core from the nappa cabbage.

00:04:53.670 --> 00:04:55.260
Cut the leaf parts into large chunks.

00:04:56.890 --> 00:05:00.430
Remove the base from the Enoki mushrooms,
and separate the stems.

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:02.430
Take the fish you left standing.

00:05:02.430 --> 00:05:04.430
Pour some hot water over it,

00:05:04.430 --> 00:05:06.400
then immediately plunge it
into ice cold water.

00:05:07.900 --> 00:05:11.820
Then remove the excess water,
and we're done with the prep work.

00:05:20.580 --> 00:05:22.830
We're back!

00:05:23.330 --> 00:05:24.510
Welcome home!

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:27.210
I see you came back together.

00:05:27.210 --> 00:05:30.300
Sakura came to pick me up
from my part-time job.

00:05:31.750 --> 00:05:35.210
Senpai, are you making hot pot?

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:38.970
MOMEN TOFU

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:38.970
Yeah, it's the perfect meal
for a day like today, don't you think?

00:05:39.300 --> 00:05:41.400
If so, Senpai,

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:44.970
wanna use some of the ingredients
I bought for tomorrow's breakfast?

00:05:44.970 --> 00:05:48.980
NATTO

00:05:44.970 --> 00:05:48.980
CLAMS

00:05:45.350 --> 00:05:47.280
We have clams, huh?

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:48.980
Let's use them, too!

00:05:52.650 --> 00:05:56.780
Um, Rider doesn't like the cold.

00:06:00.490 --> 00:06:03.070
When the water starts to boil,
take out your konbu.

00:06:03.480 --> 00:06:04.830
Take some soy sauce.

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:07.330
Mirin. Ginger.

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:07.330
MIRIN

00:06:08.170 --> 00:06:09.330
Sake.

00:06:09.730 --> 00:06:11.830
And add salt to the broth.

00:06:12.710 --> 00:06:16.340
Start with the ingredients
that take some time to cook first.

00:06:16.670 --> 00:06:21.300
Shungiku greens, Welsh onions, clams...
These can be added at the end.

00:06:29.850 --> 00:06:32.020
I'm back!

00:06:32.350 --> 00:06:35.610
Hey, Shirou, look at this!

00:06:35.210 --> 00:06:36.780
Someone gave me mandarin oranges!

00:06:36.780 --> 00:06:41.340
Hey, Fuji-nee, we still have
a whole box of mandarin oranges!

00:06:41.340 --> 00:06:43.370
Well, but I couldn't say no!

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:47.950
Hey, everyone, your quota just went up!

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:50.000
Here you go, Saber!

00:06:54.300 --> 00:06:55.960
Whatever.

00:07:04.350 --> 00:07:05.680
All right.

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:12.900
It's ready!

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:25.120
Thanks for your patience!

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:37.380
Well, then...

00:07:37.840 --> 00:07:39.880
Let's dig in!

00:07:55.940 --> 00:07:57.540
So warm!

00:07:57.540 --> 00:07:59.410
The broth is delicious!

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:02.990
The codfish is so good!
The clams add a great flavor, too!

00:08:02.990 --> 00:08:05.920
Rider, your glasses are cloudy.

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:07.090
Indeed.

00:08:07.090 --> 00:08:10.370
I can't see at all,
but it's very tasty, Shirou.

00:08:22.590 --> 00:08:25.890
Saber, that wasn't enough for you, was it?

00:08:25.890 --> 00:08:28.390
No, no, that's not true!

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:32.730
So, hopefully you all still have some room...

00:08:34.350 --> 00:08:36.110
for tonight's finale!

00:08:40.110 --> 00:08:43.080
Wash the rice with water
to get rid of the starchiness,

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:44.450
and remove the excess moisture.

00:08:45.910 --> 00:08:50.160
Remove whatever's left in the pot
and skim the broth.

00:08:50.790 --> 00:08:52.540
Add the rice.

00:08:52.980 --> 00:08:57.120
Cook on low to medium heat,
and try not to stir it too much.

00:08:57.590 --> 00:08:59.880
Swirl in the beaten egg to cover it.

00:09:00.280 --> 00:09:01.970
Sprinkle some Mitsuba leaves over it all.

00:09:06.010 --> 00:09:07.800
The zosui is done!

00:09:09.050 --> 00:09:11.550
Shirou, so this is...

00:09:11.550 --> 00:09:14.230
You gotta have this when you make hot pot!

00:09:15.730 --> 00:09:17.860
Noodles are also a nice way
to finish it off!

00:09:17.860 --> 00:09:19.190
Yep, yep.

00:09:19.590 --> 00:09:22.480
You can't have hot pot
without finishing it off with zosui.

00:09:22.480 --> 00:09:24.940
The egg part is so fluffy!

00:09:25.240 --> 00:09:28.860
Hey, everyone, don't forget,
we have mandarin oranges, too!

00:09:28.860 --> 00:09:30.570
I'll have some.

00:09:30.570 --> 00:09:31.950
Saber...

00:09:32.620 --> 00:09:34.870
Here you go, everyone!

00:09:34.870 --> 00:09:37.330
Fuji-nee, not now!

00:09:50.760 --> 00:09:53.740
Goodbye, Fujimura-Sensei.

00:09:53.740 --> 00:09:55.100
See ya!

00:10:03.820 --> 00:10:05.220
Shirou...

00:10:05.220 --> 00:10:06.240
Thanks.

00:10:21.880 --> 00:10:26.170
Did you like the hot pot, Saber?

00:10:26.880 --> 00:10:29.080
Yes, very much.

00:10:29.080 --> 00:10:32.140
I was especially astonished by the zosui.

00:10:33.680 --> 00:10:34.680
I see.

00:10:36.980 --> 00:10:39.310
To gather around one pot,

00:10:40.230 --> 00:10:42.360
and to enjoy the meal together.

00:10:44.190 --> 00:10:46.190
It was a very delightful thing.

00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:54.120
And I'm not just talking about today.

00:10:56.200 --> 00:10:58.750
Every day that I've been here...

00:10:59.370 --> 00:11:02.090
has been delightful
and beyond my imagination.

00:11:02.670 --> 00:11:04.250
Such a precious experience.

00:11:07.510 --> 00:11:09.170
Taiga and...

00:11:10.050 --> 00:11:11.090
Sakura...

00:11:14.930 --> 00:11:16.850
It's where everyone comes
because they want to.

00:11:17.760 --> 00:11:21.020
RYUDOU TEMPLE

00:11:18.350 --> 00:11:19.810
Such a warm place.

00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:38.790
And...

00:11:40.460 --> 00:11:42.830
you're always here, Shirou.

00:11:45.000 --> 00:11:46.880
Please always be here...

00:11:48.210 --> 00:11:49.300
Shirou.

00:11:51.220 --> 00:11:52.300
You, too...

00:11:53.760 --> 00:11:54.930
Saber.
